{"id":"n70590-1-9","stage":5,"title":"유언 · 遗言","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70590-1-9-1","ko":"아버님의 묘는 어디에 쓰면 좋을까요?","zh":"父亲的墓地应该建在哪儿比较好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버님의","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버님：父亲，爸爸；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"아버님","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71340","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버님의","audio":"/audio/76d85fec37da49dced39.mp3"}},{"text":"묘는","meaning":"奥秘，奥妙","explanation":"묘：奥秘，奥妙；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"묘","audio":"/audio/2642a70f384a08a476a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54730","senseId":"1","lemma":"묘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묘는","audio":"/audio/0532305aa566c6e5e80d.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰면","meaning":"安葬、筑坟","explanation":"쓰다：安葬、筑坟；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:쓰다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰면","audio":"/audio/cacd9de3fdf20ad11c61.mp3"}},{"text":"좋을까요?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋을까요","audio":"/audio/4799ead06e7db95648e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"64187c187ea07eb8","term":"아버님","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3","entryId":"71340","definition":"(尊称)在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버님"]},{"id":"2642a70f384a08a4","term":"묘","zh":"奥秘，奥妙","audio":"/audio/2642a70f384a08a476a7.mp3","entryId":"54730","definition":"出类拔萃，很出色。","pronunciation":["묘ː"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"安葬、筑坟","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","definition":"与 묘、무덤 等合用，表示安葬死者、建造坟墓；此处不是“写”或一般的“使用”。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f2b41c3481e59c7637a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70590-1-9-2","ko":"유언을 따라 고향에 모시는 게 좋겠어요.","zh":"按照遗愿，把他安葬在故乡会更好吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유언을","meaning":"遗言","explanation":"유언：遗言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유언","audio":"/audio/952ca388c115acba4f89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70590","senseId":"1","lemma":"유언","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유언을","audio":"/audio/0d23041d186ed9d0347d.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"遵从，遵循","explanation":"따르다：遵从，遵循；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"5","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"고향에","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향에","audio":"/audio/a09c591b445023ab68e7.mp3"}},{"text":"모시는","meaning":"供奉，安放，安顿","explanation":"모시다：供奉，安放，安顿；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"모시다","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64703","senseId":"5","lemma":"모시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모시는","audio":"/audio/656b87760bc7d4c470a1.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어요","audio":"/audio/3b8ae824a2c33a5f4527.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"952ca388c115acba","term":"유언","zh":"遗言","audio":"/audio/952ca388c115acba4f89.mp3","entryId":"70590","definition":"死之前留下话；或指该话内容。","pronunciation":["유언"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"遵从，遵循","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"原封不动地执行规定的法规、程序、惯例或他人的意见。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"64829bc709a905af","term":"모시다","zh":"供奉，安放，安顿","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3","entryId":"64703","definition":"把长辈或珍惜的东西放在某处。","pronunciation":["모ː시다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/070aaaab2442255e0909.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdic